<div class="w-full min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url(<%= image_path '1-phwoar-web-bg-only.jpg' %>)">
  <div class="bg-cyan-300/80 min-h-screen">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row pt-4">
      <%= image_tag '1-phwoar-web.jpg', class: 'p-4 max-h-96 sm:max-h-[28rem] md:max-h-[35rem] lg:max-h-[42rem] mx-auto' %>
      <div class="grow w-full px-4 text-center">
        <figure class="quotation">
          <svg class="icon"
               aria-hidden="true" 
               xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" 
               fill="currentColor" 
               viewBox="0 0 18 14">
            <path class="text-gray-700" 
                  d="M6 0H2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H2a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h1a5.006 5.006 0 0 0 5-5V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2Zm10 0h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-1a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h1a5.006 5.006 0 0 0 5-5V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2Z" />
          </svg>
          <blockquote>
            "Holy f*** balls your stories are great - I want to be a Sex Commando!"
          </blockquote>
        </figure>

        <h2 class="text-7xl my-8 font-['Racing_Sans_One']">Your Free Book Is Waiting</h2>
        
        <p class="text-lg mb-5 leading-6">
          IN A WORLD where wars are fought with romance, and flirting, and delicious erotic TENSION, the illustrious and historic enmities twixt the globe's Great Powers have become a BUTTLOAD more bubbly, with fewer hideous massacres of musket and cannon, and oodles more frisky cunnilingus contests.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-5 leading-6">
          Enter a world of overwhelming and delicious radness.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-5 leading-6">
          Download today and join the fun!
        </p>
        <p>
          <button class="btn-landing"
                  onclick="document.getElementById('modal_free_book').dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-modal'));">
            Send me my free book now!
          </button>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render ModalComponent.new(type: 'free_book') do %>
  <div class="bg-white px-4 pt-5 pb-4 sm:p-6 sm:pb-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl text-center mb-8">Your free book is waiting ...</h1>
    <div class="flex gap-8 mb-8">
      <div class="w-1/3">
        <%= image_tag '1-phwoar-web.jpg' %>
      </div>
      <div class="w-2/3 text-center flex flex-col justify-center gap-2">
        <%= turbo_frame_tag 'landing_form' do %>
          <p class="text-sm mb-2">Grab your free copy of <em>The Knights Of Raw Phwoar</em> now!</p>
          <%= form_with model: User.new, url: submit_landing_index_path do |f| %>
            <%= f.text_field :email, type: 'email', required: true, placeholder: 'Your email here ...', class: 'w-full text-center rounded-xl mb-2' %>
            <%= f.text_field :name, required: true, placeholder: 'Your name here ...', class: 'w-full text-center rounded-xl mb-2' %>
            <%= f.submit 'GET IT NOW', class: 'w-full btn-landing' %>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-xs mb-4">You'll also receive - occasional - emails from me, with news about new releases, giveaways, and book deals. Your info will never be shared. I take privacy seriously, and will only ever spam you if you're really, REALLY into that. Like, you'll have to do some serious persuasion. Bake me cookies or something.</p>
      <p class="text-xs mb-4">Read my full privacy policy <a href="/privacy" class="underline">here</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-xs">You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>
